  "sourceTitle": "Hot Pepper Dressing",
  "sourceText": "Hot Pepper Dressing\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Tuesday, December 15, 2009 - 1:41pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1/4 cup Red wine vinegar\n2 tablespoons Olive oil\n1 teaspoon Hot pepper flakes\n1 teaspoon Hot sauce\n1 teaspoon Garlic powder\n1/2 teaspoon Black pepper\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine vinegar, oil, red pepper flakes, hot sauce, garlic powder and black pepper in a small bowl or cruet. Mix well. Use as a dressing for you favorite salad. 2 Prep. time: 10 minutes",
